      "notes": "AniYomi-to-Nuvio port. Keeps explicit Season 2+ identity matching so later seasons cannot collapse onto a generic base-series record, while restoring the simple exact MAL/title path for ordinary titles and Season 1. Mirror selection is now per requested title/episode: 123animehub.cc, 123anime.la, and retained legacy mirrors are probed in order, but a reachable mirror is only accepted when it actually resolves a stream; otherwise resolution falls through to the next mirror. Both current /search and legacy /filter discovery routes remain. Split Part/Cour records are stitched by each live record's actual episode count using episode 1 of the requested Nuvio season as the family anchor. JW, Legacy, SBv2, HLS compatibility handling, deduplication, and Limitless DUB/HARDSUB/SOFTSUB naming remain intact."
